				},
				{
					"id": "tkZhcCizGLwBJUpOA",
					"name": "Tough Skin",
					"reference": "B46",
					"local_notes": "Lore: Grafted plates, layered scar tissue and toughened hide.\n\nDesign: Damage Resistance 2 (B46, 5/level, 10) with Tough Skin -40%: 6 points.",
