				},
				{
					"id": "tK2Tf9aRGeHLqfZNn",
					"name": "Grotesque Body",
					"reference": "B21",
					"local_notes": "Replaces the Aeldari Grace's Attractive: net Hideous (-16).\n\nLore: Haemonculi sculpt themselves for aesthetic reasons that are theirs alone and rarely resemble a pleasant face.\n\nDesign: Appearance (B21) worse than Attractive: Hideous is -16, and the shared Aeldari Grace has already bought +4, so -20 brings the net Appearance to Hideous.",
